1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''The 103rd Generation Ancestor: GongAn (恭安)''' - Page 272 to Page 273
2 CONT
2 CONT He was born in 697 AD, during the Tang Dynasty. He was a Duyushi (都樂史).
2 CONT
2 CONT His wife, Ms. Yang (楊) had two sons named Keji (克己), Lunji (倫己) and a daughter. The couple was buried at the place facing towards the East of 'Egongling (鵝公嶺), Sandu (三都).
2 CONT
2 CONT Gong'An finished the edition from the 48th Generation to the 64th Generation.
2 CONT
2 CONT He also established the name order from the 65th Generation to the 72nd Generation. That is: Hua Yi Zhong Ke (華意忠可), Shou Wu Jin Hong (守武進宏).
2 CONT
2 CONT The 11th edition of the ancient lineage.
2 CONT
2 CONT The chief editor, the 103rd generation ancestor Gong'An (恭安) edited the lineage of 91st Generation to 106th Generation and the 107th Generation to the 114th Generation. 
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT '''第103代祖先：恭安（GongAn）'''- 第272頁至第273頁
2 CONT
2 CONT 他出生於唐代，公元697年。 他是都樂史（Duyushi）。
2 CONT
2 CONT 他的妻子楊女士有兩個兒子叫克己（Keji），倫己（Lunji）和一個女兒。 這對夫婦被埋葬在三都（Sandu）鵝公嶺（Egongling）以東的地方。
2 CONT
2 CONT 公安完成了從第48代到第64代的版本。
2 CONT
2 CONT 他還建立了第65代至第72代的命名順序。 也就是說：華意忠可（Hua Yi Zhong Ke），守武進宏（Shou Wu Jinhong）。
2 CONT
2 CONT 古代血統的第11版。
2 CONT
2 CONT 主編，第103代祖先恭安（Kong'an）編輯了第91代至第106代和第107代至114代的血統。
