1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''The 104th Generation Ancestor: Keji (克己)''' - Page 273
2 CONT
2 CONT He was born in 728 AD, during the Tang Dynasty (唐朝). He was a magistrate. His tomb was located at the place facing towards North at Beiyaoling (北腰嶺), Shangtian (上田).
2 CONT
2 CONT His wife, Ms. Liang (梁) had two sons named Yongzhi (用之) and Jingzhi (敬之). Her tomb was located at the place facing towards South of Hengling (橫嶺), Shangtian (上田).
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT '''第104代祖先：克己（Keji）'''-頁面273
2 CONT
2 CONT 他出生於唐朝（唐朝）的公元728年。 他是縣長。 他的墓位於上田北腰嶺北腰嶺朝北的地方。
2 CONT
2 CONT 他的妻子梁女士有兩個兒子，分別是用之（Yongzhi）和敬之（Jingzhi）。 她的墓位於上田橫嶺（Hengling）南部。
