1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''The 105th Generation Ancestor: Yongzhi (用之)''' - Page 274
2 CONT
2 CONT He was born in 760 AD, during the Tang Dynasty (唐朝). He was a Yuqiandaifu (御前大夫). The couple was buried at the place facing towards East at Pingshangang (平山崗), Qiaotou (桥头), Taihe City (太和县). 
2 CONT
