1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''The 110th Generation Ancestor: Keyi (可奕)''' - Page 275 to Page 276
2 CONT
2 CONT He was a Jinshi (進士) during the Tang Dynasty. His tomb was located at the place facing towards south Liufengling (六風岭), Chaling (茶陵). His wife, Ms. Wu (鄔) had two sons named Shoulu (守禄) and Zhonghe (忠和). Her tomb was located at a 
2 CONC place facing towards East Niujiaoling (牛角岭), Fengchushan (枫杵山).
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT '''第110代祖先：可依（Keyi）'''-第275頁至第276頁
2 CONT
2 CONT 他是唐代的進士。 他的墳墓位於朝南的茶陵六風嶺。 他的妻子吳女士有兩個兒子，分別是守祿（Shangulu）和忠和（Zhonghe）。 她的墓位於朝著楓竹山牛角嶺東面的地方。
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT '''The 110th Generational Ancestor: 譚可奕 (Tán Kěyì)''' - Page 322 to 323
2 CONT
2 CONT Keyi Gong (可买公) was born in the Zi Shi (子時) [23:00〜01：00]，18th March 806 AD，Xian of Tang period reign during the Zong (唐憲宗) and died on 3rd March 883 AD when he was 78 years old. He was the 110 generation Tan ancestor and a Jinshi
2 CONC  (進士) scholar.
2 CONT
2 CONT Tan Keyi is considered the Tan clan progenitor for Hunan (湖南) Province.
2 CONT
2 CONT He was buried in Shan Zaoao (山聚坳) of Twenty-eighth Town (廿八都). His wife Li (李氏) was conferred to be The Virtuous Madam. She was born in the Chou Shi (丑時) [01: 00〜03:00], 26th February 806 AD and died in 887 buried in AD when she 8
2 CONC 2 years old. She was was Dengtang (鄧塘) of the Fifteenth Town (十五都). She had two sons, they are Shoulu (守福) and Shoufu (守祿).
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT '''第110代祖先：譚可奕（Tán Kěyì）'''- 第322至323頁
2 CONT
2 CONT 可買公（Keyi Gong）生於子時[23：00〜01：00]，公元806年3月18日，唐憲宗在唐時期的西安統治，於883年3月3日去世 公元78歲時。 他是110代譚祖先和進士學者。
2 CONT
2 CONT Tan Keyi被認為是湖南省的Tan氏族祖先。
2 CONT
2 CONT 他被埋葬在廿八都第二十八鎮的山聚坳。 他的妻子李氏被授予“賢貞夫人”稱號。 她於806年2月26日出生於丑時[01：00〜03：00]，享年82歲，死於公元887年。 她當時是十五都的鄧塘（Dengtang）。 她有兩個兒子，分別是守福（Shouulu）和守祿（Shoufu）。
