1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Shoulu Gong (守祿公)''' - Page 323 to Page 325
2 CONT
2 CONT Shoulu Gong (守祿公): His name was Shoulu and his courtesy name was Derong (德榮) or Zhonghe (忠和). He was the 110th generation ancestor Keyi (可奕)'s second son.
2 CONT
2 CONT He first lived in Taihe County (泰和縣) and moved to Chaling (茶陵) of Hunan (湖南) with his father, then moved to Dengtang (登塘). In the end, he settled down in Tai Ping Garden, which was built by himself, in Yaoxi (饒溪). The government c
2 CONC onferred him to be the officer but he refused. He enjoyed living in the beautiful place and did not covet fame and gain. He often invited his friends to enjoy the sight of his garden when the flowers blossoming. He once recited " 
2 CONC I had been lived in Yaoxi (饒溪) for 24 years and often fishing near the poplars. How many things did people know about the world and I just enjoyed the life now.
2 CONT
2 CONT (小住饒溪廿四年，夕陽垂釣綠楊邊，乘除世界知多少，樂得魚兒合酒沾)". 
2 CONT
2 CONT He was open and upright. He was conferred to be the Feng Xun Dai Fu (奉訓大夫) in 912 AD. because of his grandson.
2 CONT
2 CONT He was born in 832 AD, during the reign of Tang Wen Zong (唐文宗) and died in 906 AD, the period reigned by Tang Ai Zong (唐哀宗). He died when he was 75 years old.
2 CONT
2 CONT He was buried in Huta Valley (虎踏山谷) of Hutou (胡頭) with his wife. Then their remains were moved to Wanjia Mountain (萬家山) of Junhou (軍侯), which is now located in Mata Mountain (馬踏山). His stepwife, Wu (鄔氏) was born in teh Mao Shi (卯時
2 CONC  [05:00-07:00], 17th August in 838 AD, the period reigned by Tang Wen Zong (唐文宗) and died in the Wei Shi (未時) [13:00~15:00], 17th August in 918 AD. She died when she was 81 years old. She was buried in Zhuzitian (竹子田) of Twenty-se
2 CONC venth Town (廿七都). She had two sons. The elder one was Yuan Tai (元泰) and the younger one was Wu Xing (武興). 
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT '''守祿公（Shouulu Gong）'''-第323頁至第325頁
2 CONT
2 CONT 守祿公（Shouulu Gong）：他的名字叫Shoulu，名字叫Derong（忠和）。他是第110代祖先可依（Keyi）的次子。
2 CONT
2 CONT 他最初住在泰和縣，與父親一起搬到了湖南的茶陵，然後又搬到了登塘。最後，他定居在饒溪的自己建造的太平花園。政府授予他為軍官，但他拒絕了。他喜歡在美麗的地方生活，沒有貪圖名利。花朵盛開時，他經常邀請他的朋友們欣賞花園的景色。他曾經說過：“我在饒溪生活了24年，經常在白楊樹附近釣魚。人們對這個世界了解了多少事情，現在我過著愉快的生活。
2 CONT
2 CONT （小住饒溪廿四，夕陽垂釣綠楊邊，乘除世界知多少，樂得魚兒合酒沾）”。
2 CONT
2 CONT 他是開放和直立的。公元912年，他被任命為奉訓大夫。因為他的孫子。
2 CONT
2 CONT 他出生於公元832年，在唐文宗（Tang Wen Zong）統治時期，死於906 AD，即唐哀宗（Tang Ai Zong）統治的時期。他75歲去世。
2 CONT
2 CONT 他與妻子被安葬在虎頭的虎踏山谷。然後，他們的遺體被轉移到現在位於馬踏山（Mata Mountain）的軍侯（Wanhou）的萬家山（Wanjia Mountain）。他的繼女吳（Wu）生於公元838年8月17日，卯時[05：00-07：00]，在唐世宗（Tang Wen Zong）統治的時期死於魏世（未時）[13：00〜15：00]，公元918年8月17日，她享年81歲，去世了。她被埋葬在二十七個都的竹子田（Zhuzitian）。有兩個兒子，大兒子是元泰，
2 CONC 小兒子是武興。
