1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Wuxing Gong (武興公)''' - Page 325 to page 326
2 CONT
2 CONT Wuxing Gong (武興公): He was the 112th Tan ancestor and his name was Wuxing and his courtesy name was Shitai (世泰) or Yanhui (彥輝). His literary name was Ruling (如陵). He was the 111th generation Tan ancestor Shoulu Gong’s second son. H
2 CONC is birthplace was Yaoxi of Chaling. He loved his parents very much. He nursed his father day and night when his father was ill. He was very sad when his father was dead and made a solemn funeral. He hadn’t entered his own room in 
2 CONC the period of mourning. The villagers appreciated his filial piety.
2 CONT
2 CONT His three generation (including his father and his son) was conferred by the Emperor because of his son. He remembered his great grand-father suffered the experience of moving to avoid involving into war and had no chance to accep
2 CONC t his descendants requite, so he asked his third son, Jinpo (進頗), to request the Emperor to give his title to his great grand-father. The Emperor commended his behavior and did not cancel his title and also conferred the title to 
2 CONC his great grand-father.
2 CONT
2 CONT Therefore, Keyi Gong was conferred to be the Rong Lu Dai (榮祿大夫)，Lu Gong was conferred to be the Feng Zun Dai Fu (奉訓大夫) and Wuxing was conferred to be the (嘉議大夫).. Wuxing was in charge of administrating the 40 towns of Chaling (茶陵)
2 CONC . Later, 3 villages and 8 towns were merged in one county called Ling County (酃縣). He was elected to be the Ju Hu (鉅户) and paid 2,500 Guan (贯) for tax.
2 CONT
2 CONT According to legend, he obtained many graveyards and people said that it was the recompense because of his filial piety. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Wuxing was born in 851 AD, the 5th year reigned by Tang Xuan Zong (唐宣宗) and died in 4th October of 934 AD, the 8th year (晉出帝). He died when he wife Xu (徐氏) first reigned by Emperor Jin Chu was 84 years old. His was buried in Zhuzi
2 CONC Tian (竹子田) and then moved to be buried in Shangtang (上塘) of the right zone of Taiping Garden (汰平園). The maples were still there. His wife, Xu, was also conferred to be the Madam. She was born in the Hai Shi (亥時) [21:00~23:00], 16t
2 CONC h September of 872 AD. There was no record of the year she died. She had 3 sons. The eldest was Jinfeng (進峰), second Jinhong (進鴻) and the youngest Jinpo (進頗).
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT '''武興公（Wuxing Gong）'''- 第325頁至第326頁
2 CONT
2 CONT 武興公（武興公）：他是譚的第112位祖先，名字叫吳興，禮貌叫世泰（Shitai）或彥輝（Yanhui）。他的文學名字叫如陵（Ruling）。他是第111代譚祖先龔守祿的次子。他的出生地是茶陵的瑤溪。他非常愛他的父母。父親生病時，他日夜護理父親。父親去世並舉行嚴肅的葬禮時，他感到非常難過。哀悼期間他沒有進入自己的房間。村民們讚賞他的孝順。
2 CONT
2 CONT 皇帝因其兒子而授予了他的三代人（包括他的父親和兒子）。他記得他的曾祖父曾經歷過迴避的經歷由於捲入戰爭而沒有機會接受其後代的要求，因此他要求其三兒子進頗（Jinpo）要求天皇將其頭銜授予其曾祖父。皇帝稱讚他的舉止，並沒有取消他的頭銜，還把頭銜授予了曾祖父。
2 CONT
2 CONT 因此，科依宮被授予榮祿大夫（Rong Lu Dai），盧宮被授予奉訓大夫（Feng Zun Dai Fu），武興被授予嘉議大夫（嘉議大夫）。負責管理茶陵的40個鎮。後來，一個縣稱為Ling縣，合併了3個村和8個鎮。他當選為巨戶，並繳納了2500關的稅款。
2 CONT
2 CONT 相傳他獲得了許多墓地，人們說這是他孝順的報應。
2 CONT
2 CONT 吳興出生於唐宣宗（唐宣宗）統治的第5年（公元851年），卒於第8年（晉出帝），於934年10月4日去世。他的妻子徐氏（Xu）由金楚皇帝首次統治，享年84歲。他的遺體被安葬在竹子田（Zhuzitian）中，然後被安葬在太平花園（Taiping Garden）右區的上塘（Shangtang）中。楓樹還在那裡。他的妻子徐也被任命為夫人。她出生於公元872年9月16日的海時（21：00〜23：00）。沒有她去世的年份的記錄。她有3個兒子。老大是進峰（Jinfeng
2 CONC ），第二進宏（Jinhong）和最小的進頗（Jinpo）。
