1 NOTE {geni:about_me} The 113th Ancestor: Jinfeng (進鋒) - Page 277 to Page 278
2 CONT
2 CONT He was born in 996 AD. His courtesy name was Jieduan (潔端). He was a Jinshi during the Song Dynasty, and then became the doctor of Hanlin (翰林) College and Zongzhi (總制) Qianzhou (虔州), Jiangxi (江西) Province. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He lived in Xiangtan (湘潭), Hunan (湖南) Province at first, then moved to Jiangxi with his eighth son, Hongzheng. His other eight sons lived in Hunan. Because of his distinguished, his father became the Zizhengdaifu (資政大夫).
2 CONT
2 CONT His wife, Ms. Ma, had nine sons named Hongjian, Hongsai, Hongren, Hongfu, Hongliang, Hongxiu, Hongzhi, Hongzheng, and Hongtao.
2 CONT
2 CONT Jinfeng was buried at the East of Baimaling (白馬嶺), Shilan (石蘭)，Fulin (福林), Qianzhou (虔州) with his wife. 
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT 第113位祖先：進鋒（Jinfeng）-第277頁至第278頁
2 CONT
2 CONT 他出生於公元996年。 他的禮貌叫潔端。 他是宋代的進士，後來成為翰林學院和江西虔州總制的醫生。
2 CONT
2 CONT 他最初居住在湖南省湘潭市，然後與第八個兒子洪正一起移居江西。 他的另外八個兒子住在湖南。 由於他的傑出，他的父親成為資政大夫。
2 CONT
2 CONT 他的妻子馬女士有9個兒子，分別是洪健，洪塞，洪仁，洪福，洪亮，洪秀，洪志，洪正和洪濤。
2 CONT
2 CONT 金鳳和他的妻子被葬在千州（福州）福林（Shilan）的石馬（Shilan）的白馬嶺（Baimaling）東部。
