1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''The 114th Ancestor: Hongzheng (宏政)''' - Page 278 to Page 279
2 CONT
2 CONT He was born in 1028 AD and his courtesy name was Chongji (崇紀) and his other names were Hongzhi (宏快) and Qianweng (虔翁). 
2 CONT
2 CONT [Notes of Henry Tom - he was the Tan Clan progenitor for Guangdong and Guangxi Provinces - Provincial and local sources used (宏快) instead of (宏秩) as the Chinese characters for Hongzhi and these provincials and local sources also i
2 CONC ndicate that his dates were 901 - 974 AD.]
2 CONT
2 CONT He was a Jinshi scholar of the Song Dynasty. To escape the turmoil of war, he went to Zhujixiang (珠歲巷), Shashui (沙水) Village, Nanxiong (南雄), Guangdong (廣東) Province with his family.
2 CONT
2 CONT He returned to Qianzhou, Jiangxi Province after the war. Because his grandson, Bocang (伯倉) was distinguished, Hongzheng became the Xingbushangshu (刑部尚書)), Libushilang (吏部侍郎) and Zizhengdaifu. He died age 73.
2 CONT
2 CONT His wife, Ms. Zhu (朱) had five sons named Hong (洪), Han (翰), Gang (綱), Chang (常) and Yi (益). They moved to Jiangxi at last. The couple was buried at Qianzhou (虔州) at first, afterwards, they were transferred to Shaomashan (紹馬山), Ga
2 CONC oming (高明).
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT '''第114祖先：宏政'''（第278頁至第279頁）
2 CONT
2 CONT 他出生於公元1028年，名字叫崇紀（Chongji），其他名字叫宏直（Hongzhi）和虔翁（Qianweng）。
2 CONT
2 CONT [Henry Tom的註釋-他是廣東和廣西省的Tan氏族祖籍-省和地方資源使用（宏快）代替（宏秩）作為洪志的漢字，而且這些省和地方資源也表明他的日期在901年-974年。]
2 CONT
2 CONT 他是宋代進士學者。為了逃避戰爭的動盪，他和家人一起去了廣東省南雄市南雄市沙水村的珠歲巷珠吉巷。
2 CONT
2 CONT 戰後他回到江西省潛州。由於他的孫子伯倉（Bocang）出類拔萃，洪政成為了刑部尚書（Xingbushangshu），吏部侍郎（Libushilang）和紫政大夫（Zizhengdaifu）。他享年73歲。
2 CONT
2 CONT 他的妻子朱女士有五個兒子，分別是洪（Hong），漢（Han），剛（綱），Chang（常）和Yi（益）。他們終於搬到了江西。這對夫婦最初被葬在虔州的千州，之後被轉移到高明的紹馬山。
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT '''The 114th Generation Ancestor: Tan Hongzhi (譚宏佚)''' - Page 336 to Page 338
2 CONT
2 CONT Hongzhi (宏帙)，also known as Hongzheng (宏政) was born in You Shi (酉時) [17:00~19:00] of 7th of January 901 AD and died in Wu Shi (午時) [11:00〜13:00 of 12th June 974 AD]. He was the 114th Generation Tan Ancestor.
2 CONT
2 CONT His original residence was in Xingtan county, Hunan during the Liang period (907 - 923 AD). He accompanied his father, Jinfeng (進鋒), when he moved from Fenggong to Qianzhou in Jiangxi Province as a government official.
2 CONT
2 CONT In 960 AD, when General Zhao Kwangyin mutinied at Chenqiao and found the Song Dynasty (宋) as Emperor Taizu (太祖), they fled to with family and dependents to Nanxiong, Zhujixiang, Guangdong Province to avoid the turmoil. When peace 
2 CONC was restored in 962 AD, he returned to Jiangxi Province.
2 CONT
2 CONT The father of Hongzi, Jinfeng, migrated from Hunan (湖南) to Jiangxi (江西). Hongzhi lived in Xijun (西俊) Village, Qianhua (虔化) County, Qianzhou (虔州，region), Jiangxi (江西) Province. This area was in turmoil between the Five Dynasties (五
2 CONC 代) and early Song (宋) Dynasties. He took refuge from the turmoil with many others in Shashui (沙水) Village, Zhuji (珠玑里) County, Nanxiong (南雄) Region, Guangdong Province. He stayed there until Jiankang (建康) 3rd year (962 AD) under t
2 CONC he Emperor Taizu (太祖) of the Song (宋) Dynasty and then, he returned to Qianzhou.
2 CONT
2 CONT Hongzhi and his wife were first buried on the Mountain called Danfengling (丹凤岭) in Qianzhou, Jiangxi. His great grandson moved their graves to be buried in a mountain called Shaomashan (紹马山), about 5 kilmeters to the north of Cang
2 CONC bu (仓步), Gaoming (高明) Gaoming is now Gaoyao (高要) and the actual location is called Mashaoshan (馬韶山) the area in Gaoyao is called Huilongzhen (回龍叙).
2 CONT
2 CONT Later, his offspring built large family temples in both Foshan (佛山) and Guangzhou (广州). The temple in Guangzhou was ruined by the Japanese during the War. The one in Foshan was preserved well. Hongzhi was recognized as the ancesto
2 CONC r to Tan's family in Guangdong. 
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT '''第114代祖先: 譚宏佚（譚宏佚）'''-第336頁至第338頁
2 CONT
2 CONT 宏帙（Hong帙），也稱為宏政（Hongzheng），生於公元901年1月7日的You時[17：00〜19：00]，死於午市[11：00〜13] 974年6月12日的00：]。他是第114代譚祖先。
2 CONT
2 CONT 他的原始住所是梁朝時期（公元907年至923年）在湖南興潭縣的住所。當他從奉公搬到江西省潛州時，他隨父親金鋒（Jinfeng）出任政府官員。
2 CONT
2 CONT 公元960年，趙光銀將軍在陳橋變，發現宋代為太祖皇帝時，他們帶著家人和家屬逃到廣東省諸暨鄉南雄，以免發生動亂。公元962年恢復和平後，他回到江西。
2 CONT
2 CONT 洪子的父親金鳳從湖南遷移到江西。洪志住在江西省黔州（黔州）前化縣（化化）縣西俊村。該地區在五代和宋初之間處於動蕩之中。他與廣東省南雄市珠雞裡縣珠水里的沙水村一起躲避了動盪。他一直呆在那裡，直到宋（宋）太祖皇帝建康三年（962年）之後，他才回到千州。
2 CONT
2 CONT 洪志和他的妻子首先被葬在江西黔州的丹鳳嶺上。他的曾孫將墳墓搬到了埋葬在山腳以北約5公里的紹馬山（Shaomashan）的山中。高堯地區叫馬韶山（Mashaoshan）。
2 CONT
2 CONT 後來，他的後代在佛山和廣州建造了大型家庭廟宇。在戰爭期間，廣州的寺廟被日本人摧毀。佛山的一處保存完好。洪志被公認為譚氏家族在廣東的祖先。
