1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''The 116th Ancestor: 伯倉 (Bó Cāng)''' - Page 340 to 344
2 CONT
2 CONT His name was 伯倉 (Bó Cāng) or 嘉謀 (Jiā Móu), his courtesy name 之餘 (Zhī Yú) or was 雲扶 (Yún Fú), his literature name was 廉泉 (Lián Quán) or 鬆雪 (Sōng Xuě). He was the 116th generation Tan ancestor and son of Hangong.
2 CONT
2 CONT He moved to 珠璣裏 (Zhū Jī Lǐ) of 南雄 (Nán Xióng) from Qianhua of Jiangxi with his father. He got the metropolitan graduate degree (Jinshi scholar) in 1018 AD. He became the Zuo Shi Dai Zi Zheng Lang（左侍郎）of Ministry, Personnel Fu（資政大伕
2 CONC ），then he was promoted to be the Minister of Justice Ministry. Later, his three generations got titles. Bó Cāng was tolerant, generous and just, so he was respected by his friends. When he was old, he was appointed to make his rou
2 CONC nds to 湖湘 (Hú Xiāng). When he passed by 仁化 (Rén Huà), 韶州 (Sháo Zhōu), he like the beautiful landscape and the simple customs there. In 1048 AD, he moved to Pingshan Li（平山裏）of 仁化 (Rén Huà)）[now 山揹村 (Shān Bēi Cūn)）of 凡ロ (Fán Ro) in 
2 CONC 董塘 (Dǒng Táng)]
2 CONT
2 CONT He was born in the 巳時 (sì shí) [09:00 ~ 11:00] 30th June of 986 AD and he died in 未時 (wèi shí) [13:00~15:00] 17th October of 1054 AD. He died when he was 69 years old.
2 CONT
2 CONT He had two wives; both of them were conferred to be the Second Rank Madam.
2 CONT
2 CONT His first wife, 張氏 (Zhāng) was born in 斥時 (chì shí) [11:00~13:00] 1st March of 988 AD and died in 申時 (shēn shí) [15:00~17:00] 21st August of 1061 AD. She died when she was 74 years old. His second wife, the other 張氏 (Zhāng), was t
2 CONC he grandchild of the famous prime minister of the Tang Dynasty 張九齡 (Zhāng Jiǔ Líng). He was well known because he built the road through the MeiGuan (Pass).
2 CONT
2 CONT There was no record about the date when she was born and died. Bocang was buried in the Tiger Mountain of 大嶺 (Dà Lǐng) of 甘蔗衝 (Gān Zhè Chōng) of 長衝逕 (Zhǎng Chōng Jìng), in the 大富村 (Dà Fù Village). march with the 麵仁 (Miàn Rén). His
2 CONC  wives were buried in 人形 (Rén Xíng) of 大嶺 (Dà Lǐng) and the south of 長衝逕 (Zhǎng Chōng Jìng).
2 CONT
2 CONT Bocang had eight sons, the eldest Chao sons, Zheng (朝政) lived in Pingshan Li (平山裏) of Renhua. The second Chao Duan (朝品) lived in Cangbu (倉步) of Gaoming (高明). The third Chao Yong (朝用) lived in the Beixiang (北鄉) of Lechang (樂昌). The
2 CONC  fourth Chao Gui (朝貴) lived Guishan (歸善) [Huiyang (惠陽)], the fifth 朝靜 (Cháo Jìng) lived in 珠璣裏 (Zhū Jī Lǐ) Nanxiong (南雄). The sixth Chao An (朝安) Iived in Yancang Street (鹽倉) of Guangzhou (廣州). The seventh Chao Zuo (朝佐) lived in Ya
2 CONC shao (雅韶) of Yangjiang (陽江). The eighth Chao Sheng (朝聖) lived in the Dahui (大奶) of Dongguan (東莞).
2 CONT
2 CONT Bocang once had a shrine in Pingshan Li (平山裏), in the 1980's, the government leveled the land to build an institute of agriculture and science, so they destroyed the shrine. A new shrine was finished in 11th July of 2002. Shanbei 
2 CONC Village (山捐村) Xue W (学武) went to Ganzhu (甘竹). The shrine was built in the entrance of the village; the roof of the shrine was covered with colored glaze. The tablet on the gate was written: The Shrine of Tan BoCang (伯倉講蕈公祠). The c
2 CONC ouplet on the gate was written: the clan was origin from Qi County (齊君) and spread here. The tablet in the middle hall of the shrine written: Hong Nong Tang (弘晨堂). On the midmost wall of the hall was the Bocang's name tablet, his 
2 CONC son's name tablets were on the both side of his. The shrine was grand in the shrines that built in Guangdong (廣東).
2 CONT
2 CONT In the Haixin (海心) of Kaiping (開平), there had a Bocang shrine. In the Summer of 2002, the clan members of Dehe (德和) of Shaoguan (韶關), Yangyu (揚玉), Renhua (仁化), Rucheng (汝城), Hunan (湖南) and Yang Xuan (揚玄) suggested that they should
2 CONC  build a Summer-house for memorializing the Minister of Justice Ministry Bocang and the idea was supported by other members. In 2nd February 2003, the Summer-house was built at right hand side of his tomb. Many members from variou
2 CONC s places joined the ceremony. The chairman of the Tan Clan Association of the world Fu Tian (福添) went there and took part of the ceremony with his wife and sons. The chairman of the Tan Clan Association of Hongkong Peng Fa (鵬發), t
2 CONC he secretary of county Party committee of Qujiang (麵江) Zhang Ming (草明), the director of county Party committee of Qujiang Dian Xian (鼎先) joined the ceremony. The ceremony promoted the cooperation of development of the delta of Zhu
2 CONC jiang (珠江) and Hong Kong。
2 CONT
2 CONT The descendants of Tan Hongzhi spread throughout Guangdong, Guangxi (廣西), Qiongxiang (瓊湘), Gan (赣), Taiwan (臺灣), Hong Kong, Macau and overseas. These descendants numbered well over several million.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Google Transation:'''
2 CONT
2 CONT '''第116祖先：伯倉（BóCāng）''' - 第340頁至344頁
2 CONT
2 CONT 他的名字叫伯倉（BóCāng）或嘉謀（JiāMóu），禮貌名稱之餘（ZhīYú）或云扶（YúnFú），他的文學名字叫廉泉（LiánQuán）或鬆雪（Sōng徐）。他是第116代譚祖先，是漢宮的兒子。
2 CONT
2 CONT 他與父親從江西遷化遷到南雄（NánXióng）的珠璣裡（ZhūJīLǐ）。他於公元1018年獲得大都會研究生學位（金石學者）。他被任命為財政部左侍郎的左侍郎，資政大伕人事專員，隨後被提拔為司法部大臣。後來，他的三代人獲得了冠軍。 BóCāng寬容，大方，公正，因此受到朋友的尊重。他年老時被任命到湖湘（HúXiāng）巡迴演出。當他經過韶州的仁化（RénHuà），他喜歡那里美麗的風景和簡單的習俗。公元1048年，他搬到董塘（DǒngTáng）凡羅（FánRo
2 CONC ）的仁化（RénHuà）的平山里（現在的山背村（ShānBēiCūn））。
2 CONT
2 CONT 他出生於986年6月30日巳時（sìshí）[09:00〜11:00]，死於1054年10月17日在未時（wèishí）[13：00〜15：00]。他69歲去世。
2 CONT
2 CONT 他有兩個妻子。他們兩個都被授予二等獎。
2 CONT
2 CONT 他的第一任妻子張氏（Zhāng）於公元988年3月1日出生於排斥時（chìshí）[11：00〜13：00]，並於21日死於申時（shēnshí）。公元1061年8月。她74歲時去世。他的第二任妻子張氏（Zhāng）是唐朝著名總理張九齡（ZhāngJiǔLíng）的孫子。他之所以出名，是因為他通過美關（Pass）建立了道路。
2 CONT
2 CONT 沒有關於她出生和去世的日期的記錄。博藏葬在大富村（DàFùVillage）的長衝徑（ZhǎngChōngJìng）的甘蔗衝（GānZhèChōng）的大嶺（DàLǐng）老虎山中。與面仁（MiànRén）一起遊行。他的妻子被安葬在大嶺（DàLǐng）的人形（RénXíng）和長衝徑（ZhǎngChōngJìng）的南部。
2 CONT
2 CONT 博蒼有八個兒子，長子朝政鄭（Zheng）居住在仁化市平山里（Pingshan Li）。第二個朝段（Chao Duan）居住在高明（Gaoming）的倉步（Cangbu）。第三名朝用住在樂昌的北鄉。第四位朝貴（朝貴）居住在歸善（Huiyang（惠陽）），第五位朝靜（ChaáJijng）居住在珠雄（ZhūJīLǐ）南雄（南雄）。第六名朝安（Ian Chao）在廣州鹽倉街（Iancang Street）落戶。第七位朝佐（Zhao Zuo）居住在陽江（Yangji
2 CONC ang）的Yashao（Yahao）。第八名朝聖人住在東莞（東莞）的大奶。
2 CONT
2 CONT 博滄曾經在平山里（Pingshan Li）擁有一座神社，在1980年代，政府對土地進行平整以建立農業和科學研究所，因此他們摧毀了這座神社。 2002年7月11日，一座新的神社落成。山武村（Sue Wi）去了甘竹（Ganzhu）。神社建在村莊的入口處。神社的屋頂上覆蓋著彩色釉。門上的碑寫著：伯伯講蘑菇公祠。門上的對聯是這樣寫的：氏族起源於齊縣，並在此傳播。神社中殿的碑文寫著：弘農堂。大廳最中間的牆上是博藏的姓氏，他兒子的姓氏在他的兩側。在廣東省建造的神社中，
2 CONC 神社盛大。
2 CONT
2 CONT 開平海心的海心裡有一個博藏sh。 2002年夏季，韶關的德和（Dehe），揚玉（Yangyu），仁化（Renhua），仁城（Ru化），汝城（Rucheng），湖南（Lake湖南）和揚玄（Yang Xuan）的家族成員建議他們建立一個避暑別墅，以紀念司法部長博蒼，該想法得到其他成員的支持。 2003年2月2日，避暑別墅建在他的墳墓右側。來自各地的許多成員參加了典禮。世界譚添氏家族協會會長福添與他的妻子和兒子們一起參加了儀式。香港譚發家族協會主席彭發，曲江縣委
2 CONC 書記張明，曲先縣縣委書記加入儀式。儀式促進了珠江三角洲與香港的發展合作。
2 CONT
2 CONT 譚洪志的後裔遍布廣東，廣西，瓊湘，贛，台灣，香港，澳門和海外。這些後代人數超過數百萬。
