1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''The 125th Generation Ancestor: Tan Tianlin (天麟)''' - Page 248 to 249
2 CONT
2 CONT Tan Tianlin (天麟) was the 125th generation Tan ancestor. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He is considered the first Tan ancestor for Baishui (White Water), Taishan county. He was the third son of Yuanlong (元龙). He was born at the end of the Yuan dynasty when the legal system was weak and robberies were overwhelming. H
2 CONC is father passed away when he was at age six. He was brought up by a tenant family. There were many properties under his name. However, nobody helped him in taking care of his properties. Many were taken away by local tyrants. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Emperor Taizu (太祖) of the Ming (明) Dynasty started rebuild the legal system and called for  restoration of old properties. The tenant, who brought up Tianlin helped him in reclaiming several properties, more than 10 hectares and 3
2 CONC  hectares of sticky rice paddy fields. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Lei (雷) in Tangmianli (塘面里). He had four sons, first Derui (德瑞), Dechang (德常), third Dechao (德 超), and fourth Deqiong (德瓊). In the 23rd year of Hongwu (洪武) period or between (1368-1398), he was enlisted in Xinhui county
2 CONC . He was deployed to the guardian reserve in Nanjing (南京) and later to Youtun (元屯), Yingzhou (营 州) ). He died in service. He was nominally buried in Longtang (龙 塘) hill, Baishui (白水) village. His wife, Lei, was buried in Fenshi (坟
2 CONC 石). Exact dates for their birth and death are unknown. The tenant helped to bring up their sons. The tenant is a great person. This was also owing to Yuanweng. 
2 CONT
2 CONT His birth / death are not clear. The authors pointed that these records were lost. This may be because of his difficult lifetime and the war. He moved his family to Baishui in 1390 AD (in the 23rd year of Hongwu period of Ming Dyn
2 CONC asty) when he was enlisted.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Google Translation:==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''第125代祖先：天麟（Tan Tianlin）''' - 第248至249頁
2 CONT
2 CONT 天麟是第125代譚祖先。
2 CONT
2 CONT 他被認為是台山縣白水（白水）的第一個譚祖先。他是元龍的三兒子。他出生於元朝末年，當時法制薄弱，搶劫猖w。他父親六歲時去世。他由一個租戶家庭撫養長大。他的名字下有許多財產。但是，沒有人幫助他照顧自己的財產。許多人被當地暴君帶走。
2 CONT
2 CONT 明代太祖太祖開始重建法律體系，並呼籲恢復舊財產。撫養天林的房客幫助他收回了幾處土地，超過10公頃和3公頃的糯米田。
2 CONT
2 CONT 他在塘面裡（Tangmianli）嫁給了雷（Lei）。他有四個兒子，分別是德瑞（Deerui），德常（De常），德超（Dechao）和德瓊（De瓊）第四個。在洪武二十三年（1368-1398年）之間，他應徵於新會縣。他被派往南京的監護人保護區，後來又被派往營州的元屯。他在服役中去世。他名義上被埋葬在白水村的龍塘山上。他的妻子雷安葬於墳石。有關其出生和死亡的確切日期尚不清楚。房客幫助撫養兒子。房客是一個偉大的人。這也歸功於元翁。
2 CONT
2 CONT 他的生/死尚不清楚。作者指出，這些記錄已丟失。這可能是由於他一生的艱難和戰爭。入伍後，他於公元1390年（明洪武二十三年）將家人遷至白水。
