1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Added on Sunday, September 13, 2020:==
2 CONT
2 CONT Not much is known about 譚開鳳 (Kāi Fèng), but Sandy (譚小英 (Xiǎo Yīng)) says that he and 譚開龍 (Kāi Lóng) may have been identical or fraternal twins. 
2 CONT
2 CONT It is unknown if 譚開鳳 (Kāi Fèng) had children or biological daughters, but he adopted 譚開龍 (Kāi Lóng)'s third and last son, 譚文樑 (Wén Liáng), as his own.
2 CONT
2 CONT It is unknown what happened to 譚開鳳 (Kāi Fèng).
