1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Thomas Hum (also known as Tom Hum) was a well-known figure in Montreal Chinatown.
2 CONT
2 CONT According to Warren Wong (the current clergy of Montreal Chinese Presbyterian Church), Thomas Hum was a restaurant supply business proprietor in Montreal, having a business next to the pagoda in Montreal Chinatown near the Sun Yat
2 CONC -Sen Park.
