1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =譚文楫 (Wén Jí)=
2 CONT
2 CONT 譚文楫 (Wén Jí) was my second great grandfather (my paternal grandfather's paternal grandfather).
2 CONT
2 CONT I know nothing about his existence as my great grandfather (Edward Tom / Tom Tong) passed away early from tuberculosis before passing on his knowledge about his forebears to my paternal grandfather.
2 CONT
2 CONT I presume that my second great-grandfather never left the village and might be buried in the village.
