1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''OBITUARY EILEEN CHANG (NEE HUM)''' 
2 CONT
2 CONT Passed away peacefully at the Charles Lemoyne Hospital on Sunday, July 19, 2009. Beloved wife of the late George. Loving mother of Bryant, Edwin (Jade), Wilfred (Elena), and Heather (Wayne Sue). Cherished grandmother of Myles, Ian
2 CONC , and Katelyn. Eileen will be missed by many other relatives and friends. Resting at: Visitation on Tuesday, July 21 from 1 until 9 p.m. Funeral service at St. James United Church (SJUC), 463 St. Catherine St. W. on Wednesday, Jul
2 CONC y 22 at 10 a.m. In lieu of flowers, donations to the Thomas Hum Memorial Foundation for the MUHC or The Thomas Hum George Chang Fund at SJUC, would be appreciated.
2 CONT
2 CONT Source: https://www.legacy.com/obituaries/montrealgazette/obituary.aspx?n=eileen-chang-hum&pid=130104124
2 CONT
2 CONT Source: https://federationgenealogie.qc.ca/bases-de-donnees/avis-de-deces/fiche?avisID=522858
