1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Obituary Notice: 
2 CONT
2 CONT HUM, Hazel Oi Wah. Passed away May 26, 2005. Sister of Eileen Chang, Margaret Mui, Roderick, and sister-in-law Marie. Dear mother of Corwyn, Glenda, Calvin Chan, and the late Elizabeth-Anne. Visitation on Monday, May 30 from 2 to 
2 CONC 7 at Wray Walton Wray Funeral Home, 5610 Sherbrooke St. W. Funeral service on Tuesday, May 31 at 1 p.m. in the funeral home chapel, followed by interment at the Hawthorne-Dale Cemetery. In lieu of flowers, donations to the Montrea
2 CONC l Association for the Blind would be appreciated.
2 CONT
2 CONT Source: https://montrealgazette.remembering.ca/obituary/hazel-hum-1065427689
