1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =譚松興 (Sōng Xìng)=
2 CONT
2 CONT As of writing this entry on Wednesday, April 07, 2021, I was informed by my father that 譚松興 (Sōng Xìng) was most likely the owner of the other half of my paternal grandfather's house in the Changxing / Lianxingli Village.
2 CONT
2 CONT It is believed that he had a daughter, which is why his lineage on the family tree appears to have ended as he didn't have any male hiers.
2 CONT
2 CONT He is buried in the Changxing Village / Lianxingli Village cemetery in the mountains/hills somewhere.
