1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =譚瑞棠 (Ruì Táng)=
2 CONT
2 CONT 譚瑞棠 (Ruì Táng) was the first child of 譚裔益 (Yì Yì) and 陳坤芳 (Kūn Fāng). She was born about two years before my paternal grandfather, 譚沃榮 (Wò Róng), was born.
2 CONT
2 CONT Not much is known about my paternal great aunt, but what I heard after my paternal grandfather passed away was that
2 CONT
2 CONT 譚瑞棠 (Ruì Táng) is currently buried in Taishan, Guangdong Province, China.
