1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =譚沃豪 (Wò Háo) =
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT 譚沃豪 (Wò Háo) was the first son of 譚裔均 (Yì Jūn) and 陳银伏 (Yín Fú).
2 CONT
2 CONT His birth date and death date are unknown.
2 CONT
2 CONT According to stories told by family members, he was bombed to death by the Japanese while on a ship traveling to Southeast Asia. It is unclear why he was on a boat to Southeast Asia, but it is said that he must have been traveling
2 CONC  to Southeast Asia to avoid starvation in China.
