1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =譚達平 (Dá Píng)=
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT 譚達平 (Dá Píng) was born as the second son of 譚裔均 (Yì Jūn) and 陳银伏 (Yín Fú).
2 CONT
2 CONT His birth date and death date are unknown, and it's unknown if he's still alive at the time of my writing this entry.
2 CONT
2 CONT It is unknown what happened to him or if he's still alive, but according to his sister, 譚寶鳳 (Bǎo Fèng), he was a school teacher in Guangzhou.
2 CONT
2 CONT He had a son named 譚健華 (Jiàn Huá). It is unknown where 譚健華 (Jiàn Huá) lives.
